Plan (marching cube):
    - every particle emits its voxel position (i.e. voxel cube vertex positions, i.e. voxel positions shifted by half a side length of the voxel cube)
      into a num_particle-sized buffer voxelbuf
    - sort voxelbuf <- expensive
    - for each i : voxelbuf:
        voxellistindex[i] = (voxelbuf[i] != voxelbuf[i - 1]) ? 0 : 1
     - scan voxellistindex <- expensive
     - num_voxels = voxellistindex[-1]
     - voxellistindex[i] is continuous index for voxels


    - for each i : voxelbuf:
        if (voxelbuf[i] != voxelbuf[i - 1])
        {
            // roughly; TODO: race condition?
            voxelcontent[voxellistindex[i]].start = i;
            voxelcontent[voxellistindex[i - 1]].emd = i;
        }
